   "Atlas/Rudvalis/CoordinateRowQuartets.lean:6:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `theorem minimumWord_row_orthogonal_count_ne_three (w : MinimumWords)\n    (p : Point) :\n    Nat.card { c : coordinateRowFrame p // CrossOrthogonal (minimalCross (minimumWordShellLift w)) c.val } ≠ 3 :=\n  by\n  intro h3\n  have hc := coordinateRow_predicate_card p (CrossOrthogonal (minimalCross (minimumWordShellLift w)))\n  rw [h3] at hc\n  have he (x : E) :\n    CrossOrthogonal (minimalCross (minimumWordShellLift w)) (coordinateCross (p, x)) ↔\n      reduce w.val.val (p, x) = 0 ∧ reduce w.val.val (p, x + p.val) = 0 :=\n    by\n    rw [crossOrthogonal_symm, coordinateCross, crossOrthogonal_mk]\n    change HermitianOrthogonal (coordinateMinimum (p, x)) (minimumWordShellLift w).val.val ↔ _\n    rw [coordinate_hermitianOrthogonal_pair, minimumWordShellLift_zero_iff, minimumWordShellLift_zero_iff]\n  rw [Nat.card_congr (Equiv.subtypeEquivRight he)] at hc\n  exact minimumWord_row_zero_pairs_ne_six w p hc`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
